<div class="Section1">
<h1>X System - Close-Up</h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Each picture indicates a cabling connection between one of the components of the system.</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="MMIB"></a><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">MMIB-D connections</span></b></p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="mso-cellspacing:3.7pt; border-spacing:5px;" cellspacing="5">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td class="whs5">
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='mmib_front_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1026' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='mmib_front_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1026' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">The sensor cable transfers captured data, whereas the remote control antenna is used to receive signal from remote switches.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs7">
<td class="whs5">
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='mmib_back_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1027' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='mmib_back_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1027' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:10.0pt; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">There are three cables connected to the back of the MMIB-D: the trigger cable<b>,</b> the switches and the SURFA PCI2 cable.</font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs8">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="PC"></a>PC connections</p>
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='pc_surfa.jpg' id='_x0000_i1028' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='pc_surfa.jpg' id='_x0000_i1028' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p>The SURFA PCI2 cable connects the MMIB-D to the PCI2 board in the PC<span class="body11" lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Arial; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:12.0pt; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><font size="3" style="font-size:12pt;">&#160;</font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs9">
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='comp_dongle.jpg' id='_x0000_i1029' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='comp_dongle.jpg' id='_x0000_i1029' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script>&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p>Localiser serial cableprovides the link to the localiser power adaptor.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>Dongle controls software options.<span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs10">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Sensor"></a>Sensor connection</p>
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='sensor_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1030' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='sensor_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1030' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">The sensor cable transfers data from the sensor to the MMIB-D.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs11">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Arm"></a>Arm connections</p>
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='arm_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1031' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='arm_c.jpg' id='_x0000_i1031' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">The trigger cable connects the MMIB-D to the localiser's controller box.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs12">
<td class="whs5">
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:Verdana; mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='faro_arm.jpg' id='_x0000_i1032' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='faro_arm.jpg' id='_x0000_i1032' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script></span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">Power cable of the FARO localiser.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs13">
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;"><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='faro_power.jpg' id='_x0000_i1033' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='faro_power.jpg' id='_x0000_i1033' style='border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:none;' height='210px' width='210px' border='0' class='img_whs6'>");}
//-->
</script>&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;">The localiser power adaptor is connected to the PC via a serial cable and the power cable connects it to the arm.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
